 "comments": [
  {
   "address": 7680,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The first copied byte in the scene record is $04. The caller starts executing one byte later."
  },
  {
   "address": 7681,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Save and reload the caller stack pointer, hide sprites and install raster target $2899. Draw the initial ramp sections one at a time before copying sprite shapes out of $5B00."
  },
  {
   "address": 7783,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Call $238B for each section number from 1 through 9, with six timer waits between sections. Disable sprites during the build."
  },
  {
   "address": 7820,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Copy a 256-byte page from $5B00 to $5C00 before writing the padding bytes in the destination sprite records."
  },
  {
   "address": 7950,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sample the joystick and wait twice. Update the scene, branch to $1FCE when $2937 is set, then test fire in bit 4 of $28. The fire path passes neutral input onward after resetting $28 to $FF."
  },
  {
   "address": 8191,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Use the active slot to check two bit masks and step its four-frame counter when its mask is set. Select the subsequent sprite records and combine them with the slot selection."
  },
  {
   "address": 9099,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Save the requested section number in $2962. Use it to select an input pointer, a screen address and a stopping address from the ramp tables. Compute the companion colour address by adding $98 to the screen high byte."
  },
  {
   "address": 12757,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "This scene record ends with the eleven byte marker copied by the unpacker at $0DDE."
  },
  {
   "address": 16384,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The first page of the screen matrix for the background in VIC bank $4000. Its character codes index the scene colour lookup when the display is initialized."
  },
  {
   "address": 16640,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Screen matrix offsets $100\u2013$1FF. The VIC reads these as character codes and the palette routine processes a page at a time."
  },
  {
   "address": 16896,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Screen matrix offsets $200\u2013$2FF. The screen maps into the glyph data at $7800."
  },
  {
   "address": 17152,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The last page of the screen matrix, including the hardware sprite pointers at $43F8\u2013$43FF."
  },
  {
   "address": 19456,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The unpacked picture stream initializes $4C00\u2013$4FFF to zero. These bytes are still zero in the play capture."
  },
  {
   "address": 20480,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The unpacked picture stream initializes $5000\u2013$53FF to zero. These bytes are still zero in the play capture."
  },
  {
   "address": 21504,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The unpacked picture stream initializes $5400\u2013$57FF to zero. These bytes are still zero in the play capture."
  },
  {
   "address": 22528,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The unpacked picture stream initializes $5800\u2013$5AFF to zero. These bytes are still zero in the play capture."
  },
  {
   "address": 23296,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Four 64-byte image records copied to $5C00 by the loop at $1E91. At the play capture $5B40 and $5BC0 are also selected by hardware sprites."
  },
  {
   "address": 23552,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The unpacked picture stream initializes $5C00\u2013$5D12 to zero. The play capture has 145 nonzero bytes here."
  },
  {
   "address": 23916,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "The unpacked picture stream initializes $5D6C\u2013$5FFF to zero. These bytes are still zero in the play capture."
  },
  {
   "address": 24576,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Four sprite fragments immediately before the player sprite slots selected in play."
  },
  {
   "address": 24832,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Four adjacent 64-byte slots selected by sprites 0\u20133 in the play capture, using sprite pointers $84 through $87."
  },
  {
   "address": 25088,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sixteen sprite records with body, arm and leg fragments for movement on the ramps."
  },
  {
   "address": 26112,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sixteen parts in the middle of the ramp animation bank, including front and side silhouettes."
  },
  {
   "address": 27136,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "A run of body-part sprite frames in the $A8\u2013$B7 pointer range."
  },
  {
   "address": 28160,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sixteen motion and weapon-related silhouette parts, with long blade-like pieces near the start of the range."
  },
  {
   "address": 29184,
   "type": "line",
   "text": "Sprite pieces toward the end of the ramp sprite bank, including small leg, arm and weapon shapes and their blank companion slots."
  },
  {
